\ @ID 13
\ @TITLE SAGE FUNK
\ @SUBTITLE 10.26.11 · FUNK BASS & STACCATO LEAD
\ @CATEGORY MATH-SYNTH
\ @PARTS 2
\ @PART 1 Slap Bass Only
\ @PART 2 Bass + Funk Lead
\ @SPEED 2.0
\ @FORMULA bass = -2 + diat((3*floor(x/2)+5) mod 7)/12 + 2.5e^(-22*(x mod 2))

VARIABLE SF-BASS  VARIABLE SF-X

: TRACK-EVAL ( x part -- )
  SWAP DUP SF-X !
  DUP 2.0 / FLOOR >INT 3 I* 5 + 7 IMOD DIAT F16 12.0 / 2.0 -
  SWAP 2.0 MOD -22.0 * EXP 2.5 * + SF-BASS !

  1 VOICES-N!
  0 = IF SF-BASS @ 0 PRIM-TRI EXIT THEN
  SF-X @ 4.0 * DUP FRAC SWAP FLOOR >INT 8 IMOD
  DUP 2 > OVER 3 IMOD 2 < AND IF
    DUP 3 IMOD F16 0.4 * 0.8 SWAP - ROT > IF
      3 I/ 4 I* 10 SWAP - DIAT F16 12.0 / 0 PRIM-PLS EXIT
    ELSE DROP THEN
  ELSE 2DROP THEN
  SF-BASS @ 0 PRIM-TRI ;
